Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libbde

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libbde/archive/refs/tags/20260916.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libbde-20260916-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libbde-20260916-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libbde-20260916-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libbde-20260916-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libbde1-20260916-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libbde-devel-20260916-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libbde-20260916-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libbde)
  /usr/bin/bdeinfo.exe
  /usr/bin/bdemount.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libbde.README
  /usr/share/doc/libbde/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libbde/BitLocker Drive Encryption (BDE) format.asciidoc
  /usr/share/doc/libbde/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libbde/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libbde/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libbde/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/bdeinfo.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/bdemount.1.gz

(libbde1)
  /usr/bin/cygbde-1.dll

(libbde-devel)
  /usr/include/libbde.h
  /usr/include/libbde/codepage.h
  /usr/include/libbde/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libbde/error.h
  /usr/include/libbde/extern.h
  /usr/include/libbde/features.h
  /usr/include/libbde/types.h
  /usr/lib/libbde.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libbde.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libbde.3.gz

(python312-libbde)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pybde.cpython-312-x86_64-cygwin.dll

